# MUST BE INCONSISTENT: OpenActionPath and ClosedActionPath are disjoint.
# 351-47-03 and 351-47-05 are complementary: either an action path goes back
# from the output variable to the input variable or it does not.
@prefix iec60050: <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#> .
@prefix inst:     <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050/instances#> .
@prefix ex:       <https://w3id.org/aias/example/iec60050/neg#> .
@prefix owl:      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/example/iec60050/neg02> a owl:Ontology ;
    owl:imports <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050/instances/1.0.0> .
ex:Path1 a iec60050:OpenActionPath , iec60050:ClosedActionPath .
